<%@ page language="java" contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8"%><% request.setAttribute("activePage","profile"); %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>프로필 편집 · Tripily</title><jsp:include page="/common/headStyles.jsp" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/assets/css/profile.css"></head><body><jsp:include page="/common/header.jsp" /><div class="settings-page"><div class="settings-shell"><aside class="settings-sidebar"><div class="settings-sidebar-head"><a class="back-icon" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/profile/myProfile.jsp">‹</a><div><span>MY PAGE</span><h2>설정</h2></div></div><nav><a class="active" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/settings/profileEdit.jsp">◯<span>프로필 편집</span></a><a class="" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/settings/passwordChange.jsp">▣<span>비밀번호 변경</span></a><a class="" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/settings/notificationSettings.jsp">♢<span>알림 설정</span></a><a class="" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/settings/privacySettings.jsp">▤<span>개인정보 및 공개범위</span></a><a class="" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/settings/securityActivity.jsp">⚙<span>보안 및 로그인 활동</span></a><a class="" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/support/support.jsp">▧<span>고객지원</span></a></nav><div class="settings-sidebar-bottom"><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/auth/login.jsp">↪<span>로그아웃</span></a><a class="danger" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/view/auth/withdraw.jsp">♜<span>회원 탈퇴</span></a></div></aside><main class="settings-main"><div class="settings-content"><header class="settings-title"><span class="settings-eyebrow">SETTINGS</span><h1>프로필 편집</h1><p>다른 사람에게 보이는 프로필 정보를 관리합니다.</p></header><section class="settings-panel settings-profile-panel"><div class="settings-profile-row"><div class="avatar avatar-md"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?fit=crop&w=200&q=85" alt="프로필"></div><div class="settings-profile-copy"><strong>subin.trip</strong><span>황수빈</span></div><button class="btn-soft settings-photo-button" type="button">프로필 사진 변경</button></div></section><section class="settings-panel settings-form-panel"><div class="settings-form"><label class="settings-field"><span class="settings-field-label">이름</span><input value="황수빈"><small>다른 사람들이 알아볼 수 있는 이름을 입력해주세요.</small></label><label class="settings-field"><span class="settings-field-label">사용자 이름</span><input value="subin.trip"><small>영문, 숫자, 밑줄(_)을 사용할 수 있습니다.</small></label><label class="settings-field"><span class="settings-field-label">소개</span><textarea rows="4" maxlength="150">느리게 걷고, 오래 기억하는 여행을 좋아해요.</textarea><small>프로필에 공개되는 짧은 소개입니다.</small></label><label class="settings-field"><span class="settings-field-label">지역</span><input value="Seoul, Korea"></label><label class="settings-field"><span class="settings-field-label">이메일</span><input value="subin@example.com" disabled><small>로그인에 사용하는 이메일은 여기에서 변경할 수 없습니다.</small></label></div></section><div class="settings-actions"><button class="btn-primary" type="button">변경사항 저장</button></div></div></main></div></div><jsp:include page="/common/footer.jsp" /></body></html>